### Cognovis FDI CodeSystem - Permanent Tooth 36
GET http://localhost:8080/Concept?system=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/tooth-identification-fdi&code=36
Authorization: Basic basic:secret

> {%
  client.test("Permanent tooth 36 is supported", function () {
    client.assert(response.body.total === 1, "Expected exactly one concept for tooth 36");
  });
%}

