### Cognovis FDI CodeSystem - Quadrant Is Not a Tooth
GET http://localhost:8080/Concept?system=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/tooth-identification-fdi&code=5
Authorization: Basic basic:secret

> {%
  client.test("Quadrant 5 is not a tooth position", function () {
    client.assert(response.body.total === 0, "Expected no concept for quadrant 5");
  });
%}

### Cognovis FDI CodeSystem - Invalid Code
GET http://localhost:8080/Concept?system=https://fhir.cognovis.de/dental/CodeSystem/tooth-identification-fdi&code=INVALID_CODE_XYZ
Authorization: Basic basic:secret

> {%
  client.test("Unknown tooth code is rejected", function () {
    client.assert(response.body.total === 0, "Expected no concept for an unknown code");
  });
%}
